  "preconditions": [
    "Owned current-schema records and read-only model APIs; synthetic actors and hashes are not actual approvals or external test evidence."
  ],
  "steps": [
    "Load supported stored records, reject malformed local fields and compare original bytes without executing referenced operations.",
    "Resolve explicitly selected root configurations from owned SourceRelations, materialize selection/defaults and reject duplicate names or incomplete declared dimensions without changing source bytes.",
    "Exercise the explicit JSON scalar acceptance matrix for selected values and defaults, unknown dimension names, malformed declarations and consistent name validation on both paths.",
    "Resolve a selected multilevel parent chain, retain inherited declarations, apply child overrides before defaults, and bind canonical full-record hashes, revisions, dimensions and effective values."
  ],
  "oracle": {
    "kind": "behavior",
    "requirement_contract": "Ein `configuration`-Artefakt MUSS einen eindeutigen Namen, deklarierte Dimensionen, je Dimension zulässige Werte, eine konkrete Wertauswahl und optional genau eine Elternkonfiguration enthalten.",
    "scope": "Explicit supplied-record configuration resolution, local scalar contracts and selected parent chains. Child overrides preserve inherited dimensions; missing parents, cycles, conflicting declarations and applicability yield no effective result. The canonical manifest binds every selected ancestor. No project discovery, applicability evaluation or release gate is claimed."
  },
